-Teni89Ds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSauuhYDxPjxWFdbbLBBlXHUA9VlCltRYfdF7nOdQcDzg&oe=6B0C529C"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "902177588894105", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821941_902177592227438_9011808140208913437_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AgmbjDalfhQQ7kNvwEZs9nG&_nc_oc=AdpGQXkTeVC3DJdV3_B3BuvnXZH6vONcpC5LpD5X5TdqeVTsAcFKicLBzK33PVij1eI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSbi4mI3GlP6TU5RUSPrjWLKbioNaDRT5JYtFS5S_UUOQ&oe=6B0C7C83"}, {"file_name": "8.png", "id": "1535131467590915", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_1535131470924248_7326328303395485978_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G8-O753Y7BoQ7kNvwHuQDVl&_nc_oc=AdpTQjwRk2qSa9Sy5E54_rmrP7z9lVd-BLUlKsZjR2-YpQLvY1Ybkm6aRSHxLgKIPjk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQTm5xrrtpeqeEwNJM5bh7Gcm-HVlMGLfShq7HTRBDnPA&oe=6B0C678C"}, {"file_name": "10.png", "id": "930560302981583", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_930560306314916_4651222137203722591_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ObMwkKctIvkQ7kNvwGHGzk0&_nc_oc=AdqanBH6_KnDMaqs35h76aJUVMcmjJiYzjpMqbtx4j3XoSFxVypc13IGsz8J38r5YsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSB2RXKXyBLsaoCRtHByyyD84KZCaioqOMcnZ1hwNXDDQ&oe=6B0C66B1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2151024272292159", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628108_2151024275625492_2405732582427966217_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eivo7I-WOw4Q7kNvwG4xcHM&_nc_oc=Adqgum9IYrbq_rSyC0ciXX3BO5lold0w4GxiJbDDdReE2JIIBsvMDusrgTYn83WnEGU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ-zCwTpcaSrDirHrzVK25-SxxGZ_C24a45A6GtxTus2g&oe=6B0C8069"}, "display_name": "Fit River XR : Rowing Cardio Meditation", "keywords": ["Rowing", "Workout", "Cardio", "Fitness", "Nature"], "long_description": "# Embrace the Flow. Fit River XR.\n\nTrade the gym for a serene river. Fit River XR is a mindful rowing experience with no rhythms\u2014just you, the water, and your paddle.\n\n**Your Workout, Your Time**\n\nSet your timer to fit your day:\n\n* **3 Mins :** Quick mental reset.\n* **5 Mins :** Relaxing flow.\n* **7 Mins :** Deep immersion.\n\n**Choose Your Atmosphere**\n\nPick scenery to match your mood:\n\n* **Morning:** Fresh mist.\n* **Evening:** Peaceful sunset.\n* **Night:** Moonlit stillness.\n\n**Real Results**\n\nEngage your core and arms with real rowing. Track distance and calories in real-time. Low-impact cardio that is rewarding for your soul.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n* **Scenic Focus:** Pure nature.\n* **Flexible Timers:** 3, 5, or 7 mins.\n* **Atmospheric Modes:** Morning, Evening, and Night.\n* **Stats:** Real-time distance and calorie tracking.\n\n**Find your flow today with Fit River XR .**\n", "short_description": "Fit River XR: Mindful VR Rowing Escape to serene rivers. A peaceful rowing experience with no forced rhythms\u2014just you and the water.\n\nFitness on Your Terms Set your timer and pick a session for your day:\n\n\u30fb3, 5, or 7 Minutes: Pick your duration.\n\u30fbAtmospheric Modes: Morning mist, Evening, or Night.\n\nReal Results Engage your core and arms with real rowing. Track distance and calories in real-time. Low impact, high reward.\n\nFind your flow with Fit River XR.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "cont